/Title (Shift to Edge-Controlled Steering: Segment Routing \(SRv6\) shifts path selection intelligence entirely to the ingress edge node. By encoding the forwarding path as an explicit list of Segment Identifiers \(SIDs\) in the packet header \(RFC 8754\), intermediate routers remain stateless while enabling deterministic, real-time path manipulation.)
