/Title (Limitations of Traditional IGPs: Conventional Interior Gateway Protocols \(OSPF/IS-IS\) rely on distributed hop-by-hop forwarding decisions. During a link failure, they require significant time for LSA flooding, topology updates, and full Shortest Path First \(SPF\) recalculations.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 615 0 R
/Prev 772 0 R
/Next 773 0 R
>>
